{"id":"H5298","lemma":"נֶ֫פֶג","transliteration":"nepheg","sayIt":"ne-pheg","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Nepheg","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Exo.6.21;\nson of: Izhar (H3324);\nbrother of: Korah (H7141I), Zichri (H2147) and Shelomith (H8019A)\n§ Nepheg = \"sprout\"\n1) one of sons of Izhar and grandson of Kohath of the tribe of Levi in the time of the exodus\n2) one of the sons of David born to him at Jerusalem","glosses":["nepheg"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"exo-6","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nepheg","kjv":"and Nepheg"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-5","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nepheg","kjv":"and Nepheg"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nepheg","kjv":"and Nepheg"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-14","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nepheg","kjv":"and Nepheg"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Exodus 6:21","note":"The sons of Izhar: Korah, and Nepheg, and Zichri.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 5:15","note":"Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia,","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 3:7","note":"Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0467","lemma":"אֲלִיפֶ֫לֶט","transliteration":"eliphelet","gloss":"Eliphelet"},{"id":"H0476","lemma":"אֱלִישָׁמָע","transliteration":"elishama","gloss":"Elishama"},{"id":"H0053","lemma":"אֲבִישָׁלוֹם","transliteration":"avishalom","gloss":"Absalom"},{"id":"H0138","lemma":"אֲדֹנִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"adoniyyah","gloss":"Adonijah"},{"id":"H0450","lemma":"אֶלְיָדָע","transliteration":"elyada","gloss":"Eliada"},{"id":"H0474","lemma":"אֱלִישׁוּעַ","transliteration":"elishua","gloss":"Elishua"},{"id":"H0550","lemma":"אַמְנוֹן","transliteration":"amnon","gloss":"Amnon"},{"id":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","transliteration":"david","gloss":"David"}],"senses":[{"id":"H5298H","gloss":"Nepheg","relation":"H5298H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}